# BBC BASIC tokenised program files (RISC OS filetype &FFB)
#
# Heuristic detection:
# - first record marker at offset 0
# - first line number commonly 1 or 10
# - sane first line length
# - first tokenised byte either at offset 4 or after a leading space
# - next record starts where the first line length says it should, and is
#   either another line record or the end-of-program marker

0	byte	0x0d
>1	byte	0x00
>>2	byte	0x01
>>>3	ubyte	>4
>>>>3	ubyte	<252
>>>>>4	ubyte	>0x7e
>>>>>>(3.b+0)	byte	0x0d
>>>>>>>(3.b+1)	byte	0x00	BBC BASIC tokenised program
!:mime	application/x-bbcbasic-tokenised
!:ext	ffb
>>>>>>>(3.b+1)	byte	0xff	BBC BASIC tokenised program
!:mime	application/x-bbcbasic-tokenised
!:ext	ffb

